### Pruebas de Integración Servo Motor
### Asegúrate de que el servidor esté ejecutándose: uvicorn main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

### 1. Iniciar stream con servo motor
POST http://localhost:8000/edge/camera/stream/start-processing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cameraId": "parking-gate-1",
  "streamUrl": "http://192.168.1.50/capture",
  "servoUrl": "http://192.168.1.100/open",
  "processInterval": 2
}

### 2. Verificar estado de streams activos
GET http://localhost:8000/edge/camera/stream/status

### 3. Detener stream
POST http://localhost:8000/edge/camera/stream/stop-processing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cameraId": "parking-gate-1"
}

### 4. Prueba con cámara local (si tienes webcam)
POST http://localhost:8000/edge/camera/stream/start-processing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cameraId": "local-webcam",
  "streamUrl": "0",
  "servoUrl": "http://192.168.1.100/open",
  "processInterval": 3
}

### 5. Stream sin servo (comportamiento original)
POST http://localhost:8000/edge/camera/stream/start-processing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cameraId": "cam-without-servo",
  "streamUrl": "http://192.168.1.50/capture",
  "processInterval": 2
}

### 6. Test de reconocimiento manual (upload de imagen)
POST http://localhost:8000/edge/plate-recognition
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="plate.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

[imagen aquí]
------boundary--
